p='ConcreteSpec/Proofs/Memory.lean';s=open(p).read().replace('provenance. Target-dependent pointer round trips require a well-formed target.','provenance. Empty memory is well-formed; geometry-preserving updates, store, free and exposure\\npreserve well-formedness. Exposure preserves byte reads. Reconstruction is complete at both\\npriorities, with no containing or one-past ties. Pointer round trips require a well-formed\\ntarget and a target-valid pointer.')
